{
  "id": "EPH.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "EPH",
  "reference": "Ephesians 4",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I therefore, the prisoner in the Lord, beseech you to walk worthily of the calling wherewith ye were called, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with all lowliness and meekness, with longsuffering, forbearing one another in love; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giving diligence to keep the unity of the Spirit in the bond of peace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " one body, and one Spirit, even as also ye were called in one hope of your calling; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one Lord, one faith, one baptism, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one God and Father of all, who is over all, and through all, and in all. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But unto each one of us was the grace given according to the measure of the gift of Christ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore he saith,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This I say therefore, and testify in the Lord, that ye no longer walk as the Gentiles also walk, in the vanity of their mind, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "being darkened in their understanding, alienated from the life of God, because of the ignorance that is in them, because of the hardening of their heart; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who being past feeling gave themselves up to lasciviousness, to work all uncleanness with greediness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye did not so learn Christ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if so be that ye heard him, and were taught in him, even as truth is in Jesus: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that ye put away, as concerning your former manner of life, the old man, that waxeth corrupt after the lusts of deceit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and that ye be renewed in the spirit of your mind, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and put on the new man, that after God hath been created in righteousness and holiness of truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, putting away falsehood, speak ye truth each one with his neighbor: for we are members one of another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be ye angry, and sin not: let not the sun go down upon your wrath: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neither give place to the devil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let him that stole steal no more: but rather let him labor, working with his hands the thing that is good, that he may have whereof to give to him that hath need. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let no corrupt speech proceed out of your mouth, but such as is good for edifying as the need may be, that it may give grace to them that hear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And grieve not the Holy Spirit of God, in whom ye were sealed unto the day of redemption. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let all bitterness, and wrath, and anger, and clamor, and railing, be put away from you, with all malice: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and be ye kind one to another, tenderhearted, forgiving each other, even as God also in Christ forgave you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
